title UC.23 - Internal Document Upload & Approval Workflow

|Standard User / Dept Manager|
start
:1. Open Document Upload & select owning department;
:2. Select file (.pdf/.docx/.xlsx/.txt/.md),\nenter description & click Upload Document;

|GraphMind System (Backend & Ingestion)|
:3. Validate file extension and file size (<= 50 MB);
if (Valid file format & size?) then (No)
  :E1/E2. Return validation error\n(Unsupported format or size > 50 MB);
  |Standard User / Dept Manager|
  :Display error & prompt re-selection;
  stop
else (Yes)
  |GraphMind System (Backend & Ingestion)|
  :4. Compute SHA-256 cryptographic hash of file content;
  :Query PostgreSQL documents table by sha256_hash;
  if (SHA-256 hash already exists?) then (Yes)
    :E3. Reject duplicate upload (BR-06)\nand reference existing document record;
    |Standard User / Dept Manager|
    :Display duplicate warning message;
    stop
  else (No)
    |GraphMind System (Backend & Ingestion)|
    :5. Save file to staging storage & insert record\nwith status = PENDING_APPROVAL (FR53);
    :6. Send approval notification to Knowledge Administrator;
  endif
endif

|Knowledge Administrator|
:7. Open Document Approval Queue & preview document;
if (Review decision?) then (Reject [A1])
  :8a. Enter mandatory rejection_reason;
  |GraphMind System (Backend & Ingestion)|
  :9a. Update status = REJECTED & save document_approvals;
  :10a. Write Audit Log & notify uploader (not ingested);
  stop
else (Approve [Main Flow])
  |Knowledge Administrator|
  :8b. Click Approve Document (FR54);
  |GraphMind System (Backend & Ingestion)|
  :9b. Update status = APPROVED & save document_approvals;
  :10b. Trigger async Celery Ingestion Pipeline\n(Chunking -> Qdrant Embedding -> Neo4j NER/RE);
  :11b. Update status = INDEXED_READY & write Audit Log;
  stop
endif
@enduml